#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:5 13ad931f09a944d9a6bda849a46f49eb
msgid "Calibration: Radio Calibration"
msgstr "校准：遥控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:7 d4f060820e5341438b4081c9c242a7a5
msgid ""
"This article explains how to calibrate your autopilot to work with your "
"RC transmitter and receiver. See :ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-"
"calibration>` for other calibration tasks."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何校准飞控以配合您的 RC 遥控器和接收机使用。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 <autopilot-"
"calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:12 11fdcde1389140ae8abe4fbc802d4acc
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:14 9d83c9b40dcf4ce2a2b8a374ec221b73
#, fuzzy
msgid "Before performing setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:16 47ddc7360832480db13a6030dae97a7e
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:17 0115142b2ec1439b8e06024338756c85
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:18 cb2e9aa11f564e49aa4f2be9158223e8
msgid ""
":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner and connected to Mavlink. "
"<connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner 并连接至 MAVLink。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:19 14cbcc22345a4e30970b37af279a3f3b
msgid "RC transmitter and receiver are bound and powered."
msgstr "RC 遥控器和接收机已对频并上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:20 37362d2a1f2b4c3ba5ab2e9ce95f9fd3
msgid "Propellers are removed."
msgstr "螺旋桨已拆除。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:23 a7499bc940b7418eba1e345848d92e50
msgid "2 Prepare transmitter"
msgstr "2 准备遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:25 1ac26465fbb347ffa8dc44bddb50ebcd
msgid ""
"Turn on the transmitter, and verify that it is in **airplane mode** (APM "
"needs airplane mode regardless of the platform type being piloted) and "
"all trims are centered."
msgstr "打开遥控器，确认其处于 **飞机模式** （无论飞行平台类型如何，APM 均需使用飞机模式），且所有微调居中。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:29 bf27e88f2a734f3883c76efd1a289daa
msgid ""
"For Mode 1 transmitters, the left stick will control pitch and yaw, the "
"right stick will control throttle and roll. For Mode 2 transmitters, the "
"left stick will control throttle and yaw; the right stick will control "
"pitch and roll. For either type of transmitter, the transmitter’s three-"
"position switch should be attached to channel 5 and will control flight "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"对于 Mode 1 遥控器，左摇杆控制俯仰和偏航，右摇杆控制油门和横滚。对于 Mode 2 "
"遥控器，左摇杆控制油门和偏航，右摇杆控制俯仰和横滚。对于任意类型的遥控器，遥控器上的三段开关应连接到通道 5，用于控制飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:37 6c585743b5424d4b9c19cca8335957c1
msgid "3 Calibrate"
msgstr "3 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:39 50c00ac602c64c18ae512f7965452ff6
msgid ""
"Select Radio Calibration to teach your autopilot to work with your RC "
"transmitter and receiver. Select **Start Calibration** to begin. Read the"
" instructions in the following prompt and select **OK**."
msgstr ""
"选择「Radio Calibration」，让飞控学习您的 RC 遥控器和接收机的特性。选择「Start "
"Calibration」开始。阅读接下来弹窗中的说明并选择「OK」。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:46 6bf52b0a2df9420fb4186d4ca795f832
msgid "APM Planner2: Radio CalibrationScreen"
msgstr "APM Planner 2：遥控器校准界面"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:48 9eb2e500ee4f4df9ab2ce0a1e91f717a
msgid ""
"Select Start Calibration to begin. Move both sticks in the largest circle"
" possible so that they reach their complete range of motion. Move the Ch "
"5 and 6 toggle switches through their range of positions."
msgstr "选择「Start Calibration」开始。将两个摇杆尽可能画出最大圆圈，使其达到完整的运动范围。将 Ch 5 和 6 拨动开关拨至各个位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:52 aaac00541ce042c8bfe107b51b905eec
msgid "Your transmitter should cause the following control changes:"
msgstr "您的遥控器应产生以下控制变化："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:54 9c0b094ff82841579cda7e999c89d55d
msgid "Channel 1: low = roll left, high = roll right."
msgstr "通道 1：低 = 向左横滚，高 = 向右横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:56 d1ecd82a8dcb4f94959ec48e7d463c25
msgid "Channel 2: low = pitch forward, high=pitch back."
msgstr "通道 2：低 = 向前俯仰，高 = 向后俯仰。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:58 9c88640f5c3d45569c5bf7cf3e1384eb
msgid "Channel 3: low = throttle down (off), high = throttle up."
msgstr "通道 3：低 = 油门收（关闭），高 = 油门推。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:60 30ac1c8b77054a6a92ae4b8c548e119d
msgid "Channel 4: low = yaw left, high = yaw right."
msgstr "通道 4：低 = 向左偏航，高 = 向右偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-calibration.rst:62 c0ceced7e450451290863bde3164c70b
msgid ""
"Watch the red bars on the screen to ensure that the correct controls "
"activate for each stick movement. If the red bars move in the opposite "
"direction that you're moving the sticks, you will need to reverse the "
"channel on your transmitter. Select **End Calibration** when complete. "
"Resulting normal values are around 1100 for minimums and 1900 for "
"maximums."
msgstr ""
"观察屏幕上的红色条，确认每个摇杆动作对应正确的控制响应。如果红色条的移动方向与摇杆移动方向相反，则需要在遥控器上反转该通道。完成后选择「End "
"Calibration」。正常结果值：最小值约为 1100，最大值约为 1900。"

